---
// DAY-166 / DAY-206 / Mac-App-Store cutover. The single conversion CTA.
//
// Dayseam now distributes exclusively through the Mac App Store
// (bundle ID `dev.dayseam.mas`, Apple ID `6766103608`). The
// previous direct-download SKU (`dev.dayseam.desktop`, served via
// GitHub Releases as `Dayseam.dmg`) has been sunset along with
// the public `dayseam/dayseam` source repo, so the old
// `releases/latest/download/Dayseam.dmg` redirect URL and the
// `View source on GitHub` companion link are both gone — the
// former would 404 once the source repo flips to private (the
// release-assets URL is gated on repo visibility), and the
// latter would 404 immediately.
//
// The CTA itself is now Apple's "Download on the Mac App Store"
// badge, inlined as self-contained SVG so it deploys to GitHub
// Pages without an extra asset round-trip and tracks colour-scheme
// changes via `currentColor`-free fills (the badge is a fixed
// black/white treatment per Apple's brand guidelines and must not
// adapt to the surrounding theme). The href carries the `?mt=12`
// Mac-specific marker so the App Store opens straight to the macOS
// listing rather than picking a platform from the user's session.
---

<section
  id="download"
  class="border-y border-white/5 bg-gradient-to-b from-charcoal-900/80 to-charcoal-800/80 py-24"
  aria-label="Download Dayseam"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-semibold text-zinc-50 sm:text-4xl">
      Ready in about a minute
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-balance text-zinc-400">
      Signed, notarized, and distributed through the Mac App Store. Apple Silicon
      or Intel, same install. No installer account, no uninstaller to hunt down later
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/dayseam/id6766103608?mt=12"
        class="inline-block rounded-xl transition-transform hover:scale-[1.02] focus-visible:scale-[1.02] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cream/50"
        aria-label="Download Dayseam on the Mac App Store"
      >
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          viewBox="0 0 240 80"
          role="img"
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="h-14 w-auto"
        >
          <title>Download on the Mac App Store</title>
          <rect
            x="1"
            y="1"
            width="238"
            height="78"
            rx="13"
            fill="#000"
            stroke="#a6a6a6"
            stroke-width="1"
          />
          <g fill="#fff" transform="translate(22 22) scale(1.6)">
            <path
              d="M17.05 20.28c-.98.95-2.05.8-3.08.35-1.09-.46-2.09-.48-3.24 0-1.44.62-2.2.44-3.06-.35C2.79 15.25 3.51 7.59 9.05 7.31c1.35.07 2.29.74 3.08.8 1.18-.24 2.31-.93 3.57-.84 1.51.12 2.65.72 3.4 1.8-3.12 1.87-2.38 5.98.48 7.13-.57 1.5-1.31 2.99-2.54 4.09zM12.03 7.25c-.15-2.23 1.66-4.07 3.74-4.25.29 2.58-2.34 4.5-3.74 4.25z"
            />
          </g>
          <text
            x="78"
            y="34"
            font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
            font-size="12"
            fill="#fff"
          >
            Download on the
          </text>
          <text
            x="78"
            y="59"
            font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
            font-size="22"
            font-weight="600"
            fill="#fff"
            letter-spacing="-0.4"
          >
            Mac App Store
          </text>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-zinc-500">
      Windows and Linux builds are on the post v1.0 roadmap.
      <span class="text-zinc-600"> · </span>
      <a href="/privacy" class="underline hover:text-zinc-300 focus-visible:text-zinc-300">Privacy policy</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
